{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0046715 active borate transmembrane transporter activity\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/27488\n\n(The reason for obsoletion is that the term is not clearly defined and usage has been inconsistent.)\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \n\n**HGNC-UCL** UniProtKB:Q8NBS3 ; SLC4A11 PMID:15525507 (https://www.rhea-db.org/rhea/66817) - done\n**UniProt** UniProtKB:Q8VYR7 ; BOR1 PMID:12447444\nshould be reannotated to GO:0080139 borate efflux transmembrane transporter activity\n\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nNone\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-02-05T23:02:11Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0046715 active borate transmembrane transporter activity", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-03-31T00:20:24Z"}
